            <ArticleTitle>Laparoscopy and methylene blue intrauterine injection immediately after undiagnosed conception: effect on pregnancy and neonatal outcome.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>102-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 39-year-old woman with infertility and chronic pelvic pain underwent a diagnostic laparoscopy with dye-test performed approximately 7 days after conception. No effects were reported on pregnancy and neonatal outcome.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
